olor:#23291f;\">to <strong>make sense</strong></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"><strong>logisch</strong> zijn, steek houden</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">iets voelen</td></tr></table>"
